        "lineEnd": 18374
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reactions",
      "rulesText": "Parry. Trigger: The bandit is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The bandit adds 2 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.",
